    "title": "Canfield Little League rolls to 10U District Title - NewsBreak",
    "text": "BOARDMAN, Ohio (WKBN) – The Canfield 10U baseball team rolled to a Little League District Championship with a 10-3 win over Boardman Wednesday night, a game that was broadcast live as a special presentation of the WKBN Game of the Week. Watch the video above for extended highlights from tonight’s game. Chad Krispinsky and Mike Kernan had the call for all four of the district championships. The games were televised live on MyYTV, and streamed live for free on the WKBN app and the new WKBN+ app, which is available on Apple TV, Roku and Amazon Fire TV. MyYTV is available on the following cable stations: Digital over the air at 33.2\nArmstrong Cable Channel 13 and 108\nComcast Cable Channel 3\nDirect TV Channel 15\nMyYTV – Spectrum Channel 997 or 1008\nHulu TV\nFubo TV\nYouTube TV For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WKBN.com.",
